DESCRIPTION<<VER_END
PRE 4.2.0 (P3/P5): Network prep for future server PR — UDP demux, socket shim, session wire (MEMBER_LIST, HOST_NICK_SET, NICK_PROMPT); P5 server_share, file delivery (recipient_member_id), member identity and nick scopes. docs/SERVER.md: server connected roster, -id on send, local vs host-global nicknames, targeting rules. docs/P3_NETWORKING.md: application-layer protocol inventory (DNS/DHCP partial; HTTP/HTTPS/SMTP/IMAP/FTP/SFTP not in tree; server wire vs FTP). Pre-server P3 on fl_net_packet_t: bind_l4/l4_view across UDP, DHCP, ICMP, DNS, wire egress/host, loopback demux, task-backend xmit; ARP sweep (P3-14); TCP stream + syn_pkt; TLS sizing hook; ROADMAP ~✅ P3-1–P3-9, P3-12, P3-14. No cmd_server or net_server in this train.
VER_END

